# live: a computer's turn: each plot it assayed boxed in turn with the
# result (AS_I $13: the step under way; AS_N $35 the plots; AS_T $12). The
# computers go first in the development, before our prompt.
wait 240
press fire          # the first table
wait 120
press fire          # ready
until 3C 7 3000     # the summary
until 7E 135 1500   # (FXSH 87h: the ship has landed)
wait 60
press fire          # seen
until 3C 3 12000    # the development
until 13 1 2500     # a computer that assayed: the show starts
xram 35 1
snap a0
until 13 2 200      # the first plot boxed
wait 8
snap a1
until 13 3 200      # (the next, if it assayed more)
wait 8
snap a2
until 13 4 200
wait 8
snap a3
until 13 5 200
wait 8
snap a4
until 13 0 800      # the box away, the turn's words back
wait 10
snap a5
